bsites Are Still Vulnerable-and How CSP Can Actually Fix It (If You Use It Right)","excerpt":"Struggling with XSS attacks, data breaches, or third-party script risks? Content Security Policy (CSP) is your first line of defense-but only if you implement it correctly. This no-BS guide covers real-world CSP failures, practical setups, and why 90% of developers get it wrong. Learn how to harden your web app, avoid common pitfalls, and sleep better at night.","author":"Paul Serban","date":"June 23, 2019","pinned":false,"status":"published","tags":["Security","CSP","Web Development","XSS","Best Practices","Front-end Development","Web Security"],"slug":"content-security-policy-csp-a-guide-to-a-more-secure-web"},{"author":"Paul Serban","date":"June 24, 2019","excerpt":"Learn how Content Security Policy (CSP) can boost your website's security by preventing cross-site scripting and code injection attacks. Implement CSP to control and safeguard content sources on your web pages.","status":"published","subheading":"Enhancing Web Security with Content Security Policy (CSP)","tags":["Internet","Security","Web","OWASP","Cybersecurity","Web Application Security"],"title":"Content Security Policy (CSP): Your Essential Guide to a More Secure Web","slug":"content-security-policy-csp-your-essential-guide-to-a-more-secure-web"},{"author":"Paul Serban","date":"June 22, 2019","excerpt":"Uncover web application vulnerabilities with the OWASP ZAP tool. This comprehensive, step-by-step tutorial guides you through using ZAP to identify, analyze, and resolve security risks in your web applications.","pinned":false,"status":"published","subheading":"Learn How to Uncover Vulnerabilities in Your Web Applications Using the Powerful OWASP ZAP Tool","tags":["Internet","Security","Web","Web Development","Web Security","Content Security Policy"],"title":"Mastering Web Application Security Testing with OWASP ZAP: A Step-by-Step Tutorial","slug":"mastering-web-application-security-testing-with-owasp-zap-a-step-by-step-tutorial"},{"author":"Paul Serban","date":"June 20, 2019","excerpt":"As web application security continues to gain importance in today's digital landscape, resources like the Open Web Application Security Project (OWASP) provide invaluable guidance for developers and security professionals. One such resource offered by OWASP is the collection of 'Cheatsheets' - concise, practical guides covering various aspects of web application security. In this blog post, we'll explore the purpose and benefits of OWASP Cheatsheets, as well as how to make the most of these resources to enhance your web application's security.","status":"published","subheading":"The collection of 'Cheatsheets' - concise, practical guides covering various aspects of web application security","tags":["Internet","Security","Web","OWASP","Cybersecurity"],"title":"The Power of OWASP Cheatsheets: A Comprehensive Guide to Web Application Security","slug":"the-power-of-owasp-cheatsheets-a-comprehensive-guide-to-web-application-security"},{"title":"Web Security Knowledge: Staying Ahead in a Digital World","subheading":"Safeguarding Your Online Presence with Essential Web Security Knowledge","meta_description":"Unlock expert insights on modern web security threats and best practices. Learn how to protect personal and business data, build a security-first culture, and navigate the complex world of cybersecurity with confidence and clarity.","excerpt":"Web security has never been more crucial. Explore brutally honest, actionable strategies for defending against cyber threats, mastering best practices, and empowering yourself and your team in an era of digital risk.","author":"Paul Serban","date":"June 29, 2019","status":"published","tags":["Internet","Security","Cybersecurity","Best Practices","Data Protection","Online Safety"],"slug":"web-security-knowledge-staying-ahead-in-a-digital-world"},{"title":"A Comprehensive Introduction to Nginx: A High-Performance Web Server","subheading":"Unleash t